{
  "description": "The Red taxonomy's keywords (docs/healer-guardrails.md section 4), read by scripts/red-domains.js for the failure classifier, the lite-track floor and the downgrade confirmation. Text is split into words first: camelCase, kebab-case, snake_case and punctuation all separate words, letters are lowercased and accents removed, so 'submitPayment', 'pay-now' and 'PAGO' read as 'submit payment', 'pay now' and 'pago'. A keyword is one or more words matched as consecutive words; a trailing * matches any word that starts with it. Every locale is matched on every text. A false positive only adds ceremony or human review; a missing keyword is the risk to avoid.",
